-%E8%AE%80%E5%BE%8C%E4%BA%82%E6%83%B3/" /> <author> <name>micky</name> </author> <category term="Micky's Life" /> <summary>難得讀到腦動大開的書籍XD</summary> </entry> <entry><title>初級救護員（EMT-1）複習指南</title><link href="https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%95%91%E8%AD%B7%E5%93%A1-EMT-1-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="初級救護員（EMT-1）複習指南" /><published>2025-08-23T00:00:00+08:00</published> <updated>2025-10-06T20:42:36+08:00</updated> <id>https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%95%91%E8%AD%B7%E5%93%A1-EMT-1-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%95%91%E8%AD%B7%E5%93%A1-EMT-1-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/" /> <author> <name>micky</name> </author> <category term="Micky's Life" /> <summary>讓自己考照後每月複習容易些，所整理出來重點。如果有迷途點進來、有救護有興趣的可以看看到底是在學什麼XD</summary> </entry> <entry><title>從零開始：如何成功建置並執行你的第一次UITest</title><link href="https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%BE%9E%E9%9B%B6%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%A6%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1UITest/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="從零開始：如何成功建置並執行你的第一次UITest" /><published>2024-08-23T15:42:45+08:00</published> <updated>2025-10-01T17:55:37+08:00</updated> <id>https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%BE%9E%E9%9B%B6%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%A6%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1UITest/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://mickytsai.com/posts/%E5%BE%9E%E9%9B%B6%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%BB%BA%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%A6%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1UITest/" /> <author> <name>micky</name> </author> <category term="CubeApp Playing" /> <summary>紀錄在從未執行過 UITtest 的 app 讓它能成功跑 UITtest 期間遇到的狀況</summary> </entry> <entry><title>如何在圖表中添加客制化的Y軸標籤？</title><link href="https://mickytsai.com/posts